{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"1.9.0","notes":"Full access mode: pick it in a chat and Claude or Codex will never stop to ask (Nexus still blocks dangerous commands and protected folders). Quiet steps: the chat shows one live line of what the AI is doing plus its to-do list; click to see every step. Faster first replies, smoother streaming, and a much simpler Settings page with search and hidden advanced options.","payload":"","signature":"YsdwkDf/KISqu5tndVXN93k75Ap/pH8xqqyQvr/YQ0TmMPO3bJYxkb2vqCExEgz//riRPEtlHOl73VazZiOKCQ=="}